  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s \u00feonan cirrende, \u00fea offor hiene o\u00f0ere Sci\u00fe\u00feie mid lytelre firde, Tribaballe Philippus him dyde heora wig unweor\u00f0, o\u00fe hiene an cwene sceat \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feeoh, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t hors w\u00e6s \u00dea his here geseah \u00fe\u00e6t he mid \u00fey horse afeoll, hie \u00fea ealle flugon, & eal \u00fe\u00e6t herefeoh forleton \u00fee W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t micel wundor \u00fe\u00e6t swa micel here for \u00fe\u00e6s cynges fielle fleah, \u00fee na \u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6m fleon nolde, Philippus mid his lotwrence, \u00fea hwile \u00fee he wund w\u00e6s, aliefde eallum Crecum \u00fe\u00e6t heora Ac sona swa he gelacnad w\u00e6s, swa hergeade he on Athene. \u00dea sendon hie to L\u00e6cedemonium & b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hie gefriend wurden, \u00feeh hie \u00e6r longe gefiend Hie \u00fea sume him getyg\u00f0edon, & gegaderodon maran monfultum \u00feonne Philippus h\u00e6fde, sume for Philippuse ge\u00feuhte \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t he leng mid folcgefeohtum wi\u00f0 hie ne mehte, ac oftr\u00e6dlice he w\u00e6s mid \u00c6t \u00fe\u00e6m cirre wurdon Ahteniense swa w\u00e6lhreowlice forslagen & forhiened \u00fe\u00e6t hie na si\u00fe\u00fean \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Philippus gel\u00e6dde fird on L\u00e6cedemonie & on Thebane, & hi miclum tintrade & \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Philippus h\u00e6fde ealle Crecas on his geweald gedon, he sealde his dohtor Alexandre \u00dea on \u00f0\u00e6m d\u00e6ge plegedon hie of horsum, \u00e6g\u00feer ge Philippus ge Alexander, \u00fee he his dohtor him \u00dea Philippuse gebyrede",
